Description:
Essential metrics for a healthy Chromium site (LCP < 2500ms, INP < 150ms, CLS < 0.1, FCP < 1800ms, TTFB < 50ms).

Local Modifications:
- Exposed as a native Bun.plugin (yolo-bun:web-vitals) with automatic W3C PerformanceObserver script injection, Server-Timing headers, and Speculation Rules prefetch/prerender generation.
